The Treaty of Kissos is a peace treaty between [[enkoa|Enkoa]], [[taerian|Taerian]], [[amdell|Amdell]] and [[yuashir|Yuashir]]. It solidified the end of the [[bleeding-rivers|Bleeding Rivers]] era, after the *de facto* peace. It was ceremoniously signed in [[kissos|Kissos]], the former capital of the Cuthage Empire, on the 51st of Kuresohl 276 PD.
